      {
       "html": "<p align=\"center\"><b><font size=\"+2\">Social Event: Drinks and Food</span></b></p>\n\t\t<p align=\"center\"><font size=\"+2\">at <a href=\"http://www.lebowskis.co.uk/edinburgh/our-location.php\"><b>Lebowskis Bar</b></a></span></p>\n                <p align=\"center\">at 18 Morrison Street in the West End not far from the international conference center. (<a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/qrp52U4cHDG2\">map</a>)</p>\n\t\t<p align=\"center\">Both drinks and food will be provided, incl. vegetarian options (thanks to our sponsors!)</p>\n\t\t<p align=\"center\">Please don't forget to bring your badge. If you would like to bring a +1 please let us know when picking up your badge in the morning.</p>\n\t\t<p align=\"center\">\n                  This will be a private event at least until 23.30, but there won't be a\n                  cloakroom where you can leave your jackets/bags and neither we<br/> nor the bar\n                  will take responsibility for any lost or damaged items, so you may want to\n                  drop off your gear at the hotel before you head there.\n                </p>\n\t\t<p align=\"center\">\n                  <iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m8!1m3!1d4468.153875696689!2d-3.2112178!3d55.9480384!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x4887c7a479cd5bad%3A0xae6a8d6903e7242e!2sLebowskis!5e0!3m2!1sen!2suk!4v1538652252829\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" frameborder=\"0\" style=\"border:0\" allowfullscreen=\"1\"></iframe>\n                </p>",
